2DA V1.0
*
# ethren: the gods a cleric may serve, by alignment: the Estaronan pantheon (docs/world/ethren.md, "The
# pantheon"; docs/rules/classes.md, "Gods"). A cleric's god must share its alignment: the level-1 class pick
# offers the gods of the character's alignment, and an alignment change at level 0 drops a god of another one.
# ID is the CRE extension's CHAR god (IE_DCC_GOD), in the pantheon's order; ALIGN L, N or C (Ethren's own, not
# the DCC equivalent's: Turil is neutral though Aristemis is lawful); NAME with _ for spaces; DCC the DCC core
# god it stands in for, whose weapons, unholy creatures and disapproval it takes (a key, _ for spaces); DOMAIN
# what it is the god of (shown at the class pick), _ for spaces.
                   ID  ALIGN  NAME               DCC              DOMAIN
LOM                1   L      Lom                Ulesh            peace,_calm
CYFAWNDER          2   L      Cyfawnder          Justicia         justice
COGADA             3   L      Cogada             Klazath          war
BHIFACE            4   L      Bhiface            Gorhan           vengeance,_chivalry
LENYARIL           5   L      Lenyaril           Choranus         sun,_creation,_life,_healing
HAUL               6   L      Haul               Shul             moon,_knowledge,_history
MAELOR             7   N      Maelor             Ildavir          forests,_nature
AIGEYA             8   N      Aigeya             Pelagia          sea
TURIL              9   N      Turil              Aristemis        luck
MASCREF            10  N      Mascref            Daenthar         merchants,_craft
HUDREY             11  N      Hudrey             Cthulhu          magic
NASEEN             12  C      Naseen             Azi_Dahaka       wind,_storms
OLYKA              13  C      Olyka              Amun_Tor         misfortune,_trickery
WOLAETH            14  C      Wolaeth            Ahriman          death,_dark_magic
BUUDRED            15  C      Buudred            Bobugbubilz      demon_prince_of_gluttony
HEMLIGET           16  C      Hemliget           The_Hidden_Lord  archdevil_of_secrets_and_lies
MORGEN_WINDWALKER  17  C      Morgen_Windwalker  Three_Fates      freedom,_the_traveller
